Package: PhyloProcessR
Type: Package
Title: Targeted Sequence-Capture Phylogenomics Workflows
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carl", "Hutter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "carl.hutter@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6381-6339"))
Description: Provides an R-based workflow framework for processing targeted
    sequence-capture data from raw reads to curated, analysis-ready
    phylogenomic datasets. The package supports read preprocessing, de novo
    assembly and target recovery, variant-aware consensus generation,
    alignment and filtering, paralog assessment, legacy-data integration,
    novel-locus discovery, and dataset assembly. Domain-specific R functions
    are combined with established external bioinformatics tools where needed.
